kind: TaskDialog
modelDescription: |-
  Assembles a Gate 1 review snapshot from saved discovery records and queues it for human review. Requires exact DiscoveryRunID and a reserved unique Gate1ApprovalRequestID.

  Use only when the user explicitly requests Gate 1 review. Never invent or substitute IDs. An existing request ID blocks creation; do not retry automatically with another ID.

  GATE1_APPROVAL_REQUEST_QUEUED confirms only that the request and snapshot were saved. It does not confirm delivery or approval. Use Get Gate 1 Approval Status to check saved decisions.

  Approval applies to the saved snapshot. It does not verify event facts, establish complete coverage, authorize searches, or change run status.
outputs:
  - propertyName: gate1approvalrequestresult

action:
  kind: InvokeFlowTaskAction
  flowId: 09829de0-37d2-f111-a05b-70a8a599229b
  connectionProperties:
    $kind: ConnectionProperties
    diagnostics:
    mode: Invoker

outputMode: All